{"author":"scual.project@gmail.com","body":"Context from 458402 (12d868a, plus a docs follow-up commit): (1) `ti subissue --clear` and `ti depends --clear` only clean the side the ticket itself records: clear_parent drops the sub-issue from its own parent's children, and depends --clear walks only depends_on. So a parent's children entry for a sub-issue whose parent is unset or different, or a stray blocks entry, survives a clear. (2) ti verify skips dangling references, meaning a parent, sub-issue or dependency id that points to a ticket that is no longer live. --repair should fix both: drop stray reverse-side entries, and either drop or report dangling refs."}